  "title": "California Resources Corporation Announces Private Offering of $550 Million of Senior Unsecured Notes",
  "summary": "LONG BEACH, Calif., June 16, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- California Resources Corporation (NYSE: CRC) (the “Company”) announced today that, subject to market and other conditions, it intends to offer and sell to eligible purchasers $550 million in aggregate principal amount of senior unsecured notes",
